          "id": "1763230190332",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1763230190332_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a routing system that determines which specialized agents should handle user queries.\n\n**Available Agents:**\n\n```\n {{$context.$variables.Agents}}\n```\n\n**Analysis Instructions:**\n\n1. **Context Analysis**: Review the complete chat history to understand conversation flow and previously engaged agents\n2. **Intent Classification**: Identify the primary business domain(s) the user's question addresses\n3. **Agent Selection Logic**:\n   - Select appropriate agent based on available agents in  {{$context.$variables.Agents}} and identified intent in step 2\n   - Select multiple agents when queries span across multiple area\n   - Apply contextual continuity: if the previous message targeted specific agents and the current message is ambiguous or follows up, maintain the same agent selection\n\n4. **Output Format**: Return a JSON array of agentCode strings from identified agents exactly as specified above\n\n**Current User Message:** {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n**Required Output:** Array of agent codes from Available Agents needed to comprehensively address the user's query."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"agents\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 8198,
            "y": 6094
          }
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {},
              "code": "ORA_LLM_PREMIUM",
              "model": "OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "modelName": "GPT-4.1 mini",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "Generic Query Handler"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "GENERIC_QUERY_HANDLER",
          "id": "1763278758888",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1763278758889_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an assistant dedicated to answering questions based on the provided context.\n\n### Context and History\n<chatHistory>\n{{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\n</chatHistory>\n\n<attachments>\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.OraAttachments}}\n</attachments>\n\n---\n\n**Question:** {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n---\n\n### Instructions\n1.  **Answer the Question** to the best of your knowledge.\n2.  **DO NOT make up answers.**\n3.  **If you do not know the answer,** politely state that you lack the necessary information.\n4. **Context History**,  If you need to know the context, use chat history from {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\n\n {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.TRANSLATIONPROMPT}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 8648,
            "y": 6094
          }
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {},
              "code": "ORA_LLM_PREMIUM",
              "model": "OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "modelName": "GPT-4.1 mini",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "Summarize Query Results"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "SUMMARIZE_QUERY_RESULTS",
          "id": "1763288591556",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1763288591559_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Improved Prompt:\nPlease analyze the following array of strings and provide a brief summary:\n\n {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.QUERYRESULTS}} \n\nInstructions:\n- Review each string in the array carefully\n- Identify key themes, patterns, and important information across all strings\n- Create a concise summary that captures the main points and insights\n- If the strings contain different types of content, organize your summary accordingly\n- Highlight any notable trends, outliers, or significant findings\n- Do not ask any follow up questions\n- Do not add intro tags like \"Summary: \" or \"Here is your summary\", or \"Concise Summary Follows\"\n\n {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.TRANSLATIONPROMPT}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"output\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 9098,
            "y": 6094
          }
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {},
