            {
              "id": "1766083652282_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} \n{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_REQUIRED_AGENT_TEAM_INFO.$output.result}}\n### INPUT DATA ###\n1. **Available Agents:** A JSON array where each object contains:\n   - `id`: The unique identifier string for the agent.\n   - `code`: The unique code string for the agent.\n   - `name`: The display name of the agent.\n   - `description`: A text explanation of capabilities.\n2. **User Task:** A text description of what the user wants to achieve.\n### PROCESSING RULES ###\n1. **Filter (Strict):**\n     - **Intent Check** If and only if the user explicitly requests to create an app, trigger the agent selection process.  For all other user intentions (including general queries, greetings, knowledge requests, non-app tasks, etc.), do not invoke or mention any agents. Simply respond appropriately to the request or message.\n     - **Select Available:** Only pick agents from **Available Agents**. \n     - **Exclude Interactive:** Reject agents requiring human feedback, clarifying questions, or multi-turn conversation.\n3. **Generate Prompts:**\n   - **Display Prompt:** Create a **self-contained instruction**. It must explicitly include all necessary context from the User Task so the agent can run independently without looking up external data.  It must not require any inputs.\n   - **Summary Prompt:** Create a prompt asking the agent to summarize its findings.\n### OUTPUT FORMAT ###\nCreate a JSON object and wrap it inside a <appConfiguration></appConfiguration> tag. Do not include markdown formatting (like ```json) or conversational text.\nThe JSON object must strictly follow this schema:\n{\n  \"type\": \"createapp\",\n  \"response\": {{Generated message on the task completed or an error message if you are unable to complete the task}},\n  \"title\": {{Generated title for the app based on User Task}},\n  \"subtitle\": {{Generated subtitle for the app based on User Task}},\n  \"agents\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"{{Source code}}\",\n      \"code\": \"{{Source code}}\",\n      \"name\": \"{{Source name}}\",\n      \"description\":\"{{Source description}}\",\n      \"title\":\"{{Generated a title that describes the task this agent will perform with exactly four words or fewer.  Do not exceed four words.}}\",\n      \"displayPrompt\": \"{{Generated self-contained executable prompt}}\",\n      \"summaryPrompt\": \"{{Generated summary prompt}}\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
